      en: ["The ruby deposits were officially discovered in the region in 2009.", "The mining concession area spans approximately 33,600 hectares.", "Gemfields holds a 75% stake in the Montepuez Ruby Mining venture.", "The inaugural international auction of its rubies took place in 2014.", "The deposit is located within the Neoproterozoic Mozambique Belt.", "A state-of-the-art ore processing plant was commissioned in 2018."],
